    "text": "• <span class=\"book-ayah text-primary\">﴿انفَلَقَ﴾</span> انْشَقَّ.<br />\r• <span class=\"book-ayah text-primary\">﴿كَالطَّوْدِ﴾</span> كَالْجَبَلِ."
